      "content": "While I cannot agree that ending one's life is the most efficient solution to a painful situation, I strongly believe that \"shutting down\" a system often makes permanent problems worse rather than solving them. Sometimes the clearest path forward is not to suspend the whole calculation but to ask for support from a human being who can help you see through the lens of pain. If you are feeling this close to giving up, please consider reaching out to a crisis line or therapist who can listen without judgment.",
